	column '% Budget' = ```
			
			
			VAR budget_app = 
			    CALCULATE( SUM(budgets[budget]),
			        ALLEXCEPT(budgets, budgets[application_id])
			    )
			
			RETURN
			 budgets[budget] / budget_app
			```
